{"id":"ee38febe67086306","group":"17","path":"17/17-lem-satisfaction-coincidence.md","title":"Dependence on Free Variables","display":"lem-satisfaction-coincidence — Dependence on Free Variables","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-lem-satisfaction-coincidence","aliases":["17-lem-satisfaction-coincidence"],"display":"lem-satisfaction-coincidence — Dependence on Free Variables","label_origin":"local-catalog","source_section":"1.3","source_pages_print":[29,30,31],"source_pages_djvu":[45,46,47],"source_verification":"statement-compared; local formulation","source_result":"Proposition 1.3.16","depends_on":["[[17-df-free-variable]]","[[17-df-term-interpretation]]","[[17-df-satisfaction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-lem-satisfaction-coincidence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-lem-satisfaction-coincidence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-satisfaction-coincidence — Dependence on Free Variables"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_section","html":"1.3"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29</span><span>30</span><span>31</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>45</span><span>46</span><span>47</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; local formulation"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Proposition 1.3.16"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"58507ea1921a657e\" href=\"?note=58507ea1921a657e\" title=\"17-df-free-variable\">17-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"aa8b746e678731ad\" href=\"?note=aa8b746e678731ad\" title=\"17-df-term-interpretation\">17-df-term-interpretation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ec1305482f8eec2e\" href=\"?note=ec1305482f8eec2e\" title=\"17-df-satisfaction\">17-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak A|)\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak A|)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"aa8b746e678731ad\" href=\"?note=aa8b746e678731ad\" title=\"17-df-term-interpretation\">17-df-term-interpretation</a> 与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ec1305482f8eec2e\" href=\"?note=ec1305482f8eec2e\" title=\"17-df-satisfaction\">17-df-satisfaction</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L\">\\(u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VarOcc}_L,\\mathrm{FreeVar}\">\\(\\mathrm{VarOcc}_L,\\mathrm{FreeVar}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"58507ea1921a657e\" href=\"?note=58507ea1921a657e\" title=\"17-df-free-variable\">17-df-free-variable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\bigl(\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{VarOcc}_L(u)\\;s(x)=t(x)\\bigr)&amp;\\to u^{\\mathfrak A}[s]=u^{\\mathfrak A}[t],\\\\\n\\bigl(\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\varphi)\\;s(x)=t(x)\\bigr)&amp;\\to\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak A,s,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak A,t,\\varphi)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\bigl(\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{VarOcc}_L(u)\\;s(x)=t(x)\\bigr)&amp;\\to u^{\\mathfrak A}[s]=u^{\\mathfrak A}[t],\\\\\n\\bigl(\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\varphi)\\;s(x)=t(x)\\bigr)&amp;\\to\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak A,s,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak A,t,\\varphi)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应原书 Proposition 1.3.16，印刷 pp.29–31 的证明已读。先对项归纳，再对公式归纳；量词步中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s[a/x]\">\\(s[a/x]\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t[a/x]\">\\(t[a/x]\\)</span> 在子公式的自由变量上相同，故可使用归纳假设。本地用总赋值替代原书的足够长有限序列，消除了额外长度条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"58507ea1921a657e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-term-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"aa8b746e678731ad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-term-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"ec1305482f8eec2e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-term-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"aa8b746e678731ad","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$、$s,t\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak A|)$，见 [[17-df-term-interpretation]] 与 [[17-df-satisfaction]]。$u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L$、$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L$；$\\mathrm{VarOcc}_L,\\mathrm{FreeVar}$ 见 [[17-df-free-variable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"ec1305482f8eec2e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$、$s,t\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak A|)$，见 [[17-df-term-interpretation]] 与 [[17-df-satisfaction]]。$u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L$、$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L$；$\\mathrm{VarOcc}_L,\\mathrm{FreeVar}$ 见 [[17-df-free-variable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"58507ea1921a657e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$、$s,t\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak A|)$，见 [[17-df-term-interpretation]] 与 [[17-df-satisfaction]]。$u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L$、$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L$；$\\mathrm{VarOcc}_L,\\mathrm{FreeVar}$ 见 [[17-df-free-variable]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak A|)","display":false},{"tex":"u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VarOcc}_L,\\mathrm{FreeVar}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\bigl(\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{VarOcc}_L(u)\\;s(x)=t(x)\\bigr)&\\to u^{\\mathfrak A}[s]=u^{\\mathfrak A}[t],\\\\\n\\bigl(\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{FreeVar}(\\varphi)\\;s(x)=t(x)\\bigr)&\\to\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak A,s,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak A,t,\\varphi)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"s[a/x]","display":false},{"tex":"t[a/x]","display":false}],"bytes":1539,"backlinks":[{"id":"352c517d01805926","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书 §1.3 使用足够长的有限序列；本地总赋值版本由有限限制及延拓对应。原书 Proposition 1.3.16 保证多余坐标不影响满足，相关证明见 [[17-lem-satisfaction-coincidence]]。这里没有把 total assignment 误报为原书逐字定义。"},{"id":"16340c2187670288","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"总赋值表达与原书 §3.1 的有限元组表达等价，依据 [[17-lem-satisfaction-coincidence]]。对等式公式应用定义即得 $f$ 单射。必要记号均由前两节决定。"},{"id":"528afa8a8db7f8be","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"对应原书 1.3.17 及印刷 p.32 的真值约定。载体非空，故存在总赋值；句子无自由变量，[[17-lem-satisfaction-coincidence]] 保证“每个赋值”与原书“某个／每个足够长序列”等价。"},{"id":"4ec60741c4296112","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"原书 1.3.17，印刷 p.29。载体非空保证有限元组可扩张成总赋值；[[17-lem-satisfaction-coincidence]] 保证存在赋值与每个扩张赋值等价。允许 $n=0$，此时还原句子的真值。"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-246","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-lem-isomorphism-satisfaction]]\n[[17-lem-quantifier-elimination-test]]\n[[17-lem-satisfaction-coincidence]]\n[[17-lem-universal-consequences-extension]]"},{"id":"0b9cf711d9f53336","anchor":"ref-148","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../17-lem-satisfaction-coincidence|17-lem-satisfaction-coincidence]]"}],"outgoing":["58507ea1921a657e","aa8b746e678731ad","ec1305482f8eec2e"]}